# The control for p6_tree_speed_fast: 24 nodes at 50x
# (tree.html?nodes=24&seed=7&links=none&gpu=off&physics_speed=50), cheap
# enough that the budget never binds and the canvas runs every tick owed.
assert snap ready == true
assert snap physics-speed == 50
click role:button Play physics
settle 2
assert snap physics-paused == false
click role:combobox Arrangement
settle 1
click role:option Free (physics alone)
settle 1
click role:button Apply arrangement
settle 1
assert snap layout == free
settle 4
timing start speed-fast-control
settle 4
timing stop
log-physics fast-control
log-pace fast-control
assert snap physics-budget-bound == false
assert snap physics-effective-speed >= 25
# A light page, still slower than 60 Hz: the period is capped here too.
assert snap display-period-ms <= 16.7
assert snap physics-budget-us <= 8333
# Each frame's admitted ticks inside its own budget plus the clock's 100 us
# grain, over every window, as p6_tree_speed_fast.
assert snap pace-gated-frames >= 1
assert snap pace-over-budget-us <= 100
assert snap pace-over-budget-worst-us <= 100
assert snap pace-over-grain-frames == 0
assert snap finite == true
log p6 speed fast control receipt complete
